## Project Documentation

## Overview

This folder documents the data preparation, quality checks, validation procedures, and analytical limitations of the 
Compensation Equity Analysis project.

## Data Quality Checks

The analysis included reviewing:

Missing values.
Duplicate records.
Inconsistent text values.
Data types and formatting.
Consistency between summary calculations and supporting analyses.
Validation

Reported metrics should be checked against the cleaned dataset and the underlying calculations before publication.

Any differences between Excel summaries, formulas, and PivotTables should be investigated and resolved where possible.

Analytical Limitations

Salary differences should not automatically be interpreted as evidence of inequity or discrimination. Further analysis 
of relevant employee and job characteristics may be necessary.
